OL,3,GNEWSASocial supermarket reports
OL,4,Ahundreds of sign-ups
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "social supermarket" offering low
OL,7,Fcost groceries and budgeting advice
OL,8,Fsays it has had 600 sign-ups in its
OL,9,Ffirst year.
OL,11,FThe Dartford Larder in Kent opened in
OL,12,FJuly 2025 and operates a subscription
OL,13,Fmodel, where members pay #4.50 to visit
OL,14,Feach week for essential items including
OL,15,Funlimited fruit and vegetables.
OL,17,FThe facility, on Copperfields Walk, is
OL,18,Frun by Crossways Community Church, the
OL,19,FHealthy Living Centre and Dartford
OL,20,FBorough Council.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
